  "name": "blake2",
  "description": "The BLAKE2 reference source code package provides portable and high-performance implementations of the BLAKE2 cryptographic hash function suite, including the 64-bit BLAKE2b and 32-bit BLAKE2s algorithms. It features SIMD-optimized C implementations leveraging SSE2, SSSE3, SSE4.1, AVX, and XOP extensions to maximize throughput on x86_64 architectures. The repository further includes parallelized variants (BLAKE2bp and BLAKE2sp) that employ a tree hashing structure for multicore efficiency, as well as a native C# implementation and CLI benchmarking tools.",
